1
00:00:00,902 --> 00:00:03,532
Yeah, I feel pretty good about myseIf.

2
00:00:06,032 --> 00:00:07,492
Do you think we can outrun him?

3
00:00:07,700 --> 00:00:10,870
(Sheldon:)I don't need to outrun him.
I just need to outrun you.

4
00:00:16,584 --> 00:00:18,004
(Bernadette:)I don't feel good about this.

5
00:00:18,211 --> 00:00:20,961
Well, then, sit in the car
and keep it running.

6
00:00:21,172 --> 00:00:23,802
(Amy:)You were right. A whole new load.

7
00:00:26,385 --> 00:00:29,675
(Penny:)Come on, yoga top.
Momma needs a new yoga top.

8
00:00:29,889 --> 00:00:32,429
(Amy:)Check it out, Bernadette.
Suede boots. Your size.

9
00:00:33,267 --> 00:00:37,147
(Bernadette:)God, they're cute.
Oh, why did they have to be cute?

10
00:00:37,814 --> 00:00:39,814
(Penny:)Wait, wait, wait, guys. Just hang on.

11
00:00:40,024 --> 00:00:41,854
What is it? The fuzz?

12
00:00:45,196 --> 00:00:47,736
Oh, look at us. What are we doing?

13
00:00:48,491 --> 00:00:50,411
I was following you
to a life of crime...

14
00:00:50,618 --> 00:00:53,748
(Amy:)...looking forward
to the day we might be cell mates.

15
00:00:57,834 --> 00:00:59,664
(Amy:)I don't know about Bernadette.

16
00:01:01,003 --> 00:01:02,843
No, this is wrong.

17
00:01:03,047 --> 00:01:05,257
Let's put everything back. Come on.

18
00:01:05,466 --> 00:01:06,796
(Leonard:)Here.

19
00:01:16,310 --> 00:01:20,270
(Bernadette(taking boots and running):)It's okay, I serve soup to poor people.

